	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"viewend"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010020e"},
		line=580,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Looks like things could be going better with Hotori-san.”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"On the way home, the manager starts a conversation.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? Oh, yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Try not to hold it against her. She has no choice but to act like that.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“She's the acting chairman and the head of House Inou, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Given that, she can't just believe your story that easily.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin said the same thing.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Hotori-san is trying to carry the entire weight of her family all by herself.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Though, now that I think about it, I suppose you two share that in common.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"I don't have an immediate reply.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"No matter how justified it might be, it doesn't feel good to be mistrusted.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“You saw all those warriors at Miyoshi, right? Did you happen to notice anything?”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Notice what?”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hmm, well, they were all dressed so that you wouldn't recognize them as warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“You're an observant one. Can you guess why?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“To avoid attracting attention from the Republic, right?”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“That is one reason. But there's another reason as well.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"I think about it, but I can't figure it out.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“It's to avoid the glares from the rest of the world.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Are you talking about the citizens of the Empire?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"The manager solemnly nods.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"Crossing his arms, he looks up at the night sky, lost in thought.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“You're aware of Okonogi's tyranny, yes?”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Someone you know getting arrested and never coming back is a daily occurrence. You could get shot dead on the spot, and nobody would bat an eye.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Even worse, Republic soldiers are running roughshod, and the Imperial Police turn a blind eye no matter what they do.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“In fact, Imperials get arrested for so much as complaining about it.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Indeed, there've been more than a handful of folks\nwho've refused to pay me.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Republicans love having these banquets they call   ≪parties,≫ and they'll order a whole bunch of flowers for them.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“One time, we fulfilled an order for enough roses to fill an entire room.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Naturally, we never heard a word from them about payment afterwards.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"The manager says with a weak smile.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Oh, I'm getting sidetracked.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“My point is, everyone is chafing at the situation and looking for an outlet for their frustrations.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Ah, I had a feeling it would be like this.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Despite hoping against hope that I was mistaken, I already feel a sense of resignation washing over me.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“And so that's why Soujin-kun and the rest of the warriors ended up receiving the brunt of everyone's criticism.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Whether it's losing the war, or everyone's life being in the pits, it's all the warriors' fault now.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Even the state press is making the warriors out to be war criminals. It's truly horrible.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Soujin-kun's even come home covered in egg a few times.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Hotori-san's probably gotten it even worse. She is of House Inou, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How awful.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"Knowing Soujin, he would have no trouble at all avoiding an egg thrown at him.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"But he's the type to resign himself and submit to it.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“That's why everyone hates dressing in a way that identifies them as warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“The most obvious way, of course, would be to not carry a blade.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Come to think of it, none of the warriors I saw at Miyoshi were wearing their blades.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"But then I realize.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou always wears hers.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Indeed. Hotori-san is the only one that still keeps her blade on her person.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Because she doesn't want to cast away her pride as an Inou?”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Most likely. She also needs to set an example as acting chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“That's just the kind of person Hotori-san is.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"The manager gives me a kindly smile.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"I know how awkward she can be sometimes.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"I also know that her doubts about my lineage are a reflection of the strength of her fealty.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"But still, you know...",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Hmm.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"I feel a vague sense of itchiness and scratch at the top of my head with my finger.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"We're kindred spirits, in a sense.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"I, too, have been fighting all this time for what I have to protect.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"If I close my eyes, I can see all those days I spent in Iseya as vividly as if it were yesterday.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"The pride of the Imperial Family, revenge for my mother's death─",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"With that motivation as sustenance, I devoted every waking moment to training in the blade arts.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're a kind person.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“You think so? I don't really th─”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“*Cough cough?!* *Hack, hack...*”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"He suddenly doubles over in a coughing fit.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I'm not a kind person. Not in the slightest.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"He weakly whispers, floating an ephemeral smile at the same time.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Oh, so this is what he meant...)”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"I remember what Soujin said to me.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“When it comes to the manager, it's like he could keel over at any moment, so it makes you want to look after him, right?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, totally. Whenever he coughs, I'm always afraid he'll spit up blood.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And yet... he's the healthiest person you'll ever meet.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh!?”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You might think the way he talks is always so full of implication, like he's still pining after the one that got away, but...”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But?”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nothing of that sort has ever happened.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And even if it did, he's probably still having a grand old time consorting with multiple somebodies right as we speak.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're kidding me!”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Well, you know, I'm getting on in years. I hope you'll indulge me in imparting some sagely, middle-aged wisdom.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(I totally see it. I bet tons of ladies fall for that.)”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Akari-san?”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Uh, yes! I understand!”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"I panic and pretend I was paying attention.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll think about how to work things out with Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even Soujin's probably carrying some burdens he isn't telling me about.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Oh, I think he's very much fine.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Wait, he actually doesn't have any burdens?",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Ever since he met you, it's like a fire got lit under him.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, he could definitely use a little warming up.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Indeed, he's serious, composed, and hard-headed, not to mention a bit of a jerk at times, so I can see why you'd think that.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“But before, he was constantly on edge, like he was taking out his anger on himself.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“It feels like all that's flown out the window the past few days.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"I was the one that changed Soujin?",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Just the mere thought of that fills me up with elation.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I think you'd do him a lot of good if you kept putting his nose to the grindstone.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“He'll grumble about it, but he'll really be glad for it.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hehee, that's some interesting advice.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"First I changed how I see Inou, and now I'm seeing Soujin in a new light, too.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Were you two talking about me?”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Eep!”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Without a sound, Soujin suddenly appears behind the manager.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Certainly not. Isn't that right, manager?”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“B-But of course.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Okay.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"With his usual brusque tone, Soujin falls in step with us.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“'At last, the tidings of spring are beginning to show themselves. Onii-sama, are you in good health?'”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“'Your Kanami is faring well for herself.'”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“'I am so well, indeed, that I cannot help but recall when you teased me by saying, ‘You're too sturdy to ever catch\ncold.’'”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"11:30 in the evening.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"I face my diary at the same time as always, with not even a minute of deviation.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"Rather than my personality, it is my circumstances that force me to live such a fastidious lifestyle.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Empress Hisui, the eighty-seventh sovereign of the Empire, is a very carefully designed construct.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"As the one who personifies this construct, I have to conduct myself precisely according to its design.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Rise from bed, wash up, undergo a physical, take my meal, move about, greet people.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"How to speak, how to smile, how to show sadness, how to show joy, how to live.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"I have to act exactly according to their designs, even up to the death they likely have in store for me.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Because of this, I now live such a regulated lifestyle, even though I've always been a bit of a free spirit.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“'Today, I traveled to Senshu on official business─that very same Senshu where we went swimming oh so long\nago.'”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“'Back then, I mistakenly touched a jellyfish and caused quite the stir.'”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“'Even after all these years, whenever I think back to that day, I can still feel that stinging sensation on my arm.'”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"The pages of this diary are the only place I can discard the construct of Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Only within the confines of this lined parchment am I able to talk to Onii-sama as Tokita Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"I must not voice my thoughts aloud.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Even the slightest sound in this room is monitored by Okonogi.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"He may even be surveilling me on video, but so far, he\nhasn't accosted me for keeping this diary.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“'Oh, yes. I have an important announcement for you,\nOnii-sama.'”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“'My wishes have finally been granted, and I have been permitted to attend school.'”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“'I have been ordered to attend a public academy, that I might ingratiate myself with the commoners.'”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“'It will likely only be once or twice a month, but my heart already threatens to burst from all the nerves.'”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“'Because if I might visit the outside world, it is not outside the realm of possibility that I could cross paths with you.'”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"However, even if I were to meet him, Onii-sama may not realize me for who I am.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"I lay down my pen and stroke my hair.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Under orders from Okonogi, I've changed its color and style since three years ago.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"I've grown taller, as well, and my chest has perhaps... no, has definitely gotten bigger!",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"And besides, even if Onii-sama does recognize me, I absolutely cannot simply leap into his arms.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"If Okonogi were to find out about Onii-sama, he will surely have him killed.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"─Even if we were to meet, I must not call out to you.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"─I may only ever watch you from afar.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“'Onii-sama, your Kanami is living her best only because you saved her.'”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“'Are you safe and sound, I wonder?'”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“'I shall have faith that we will surely meet again someday, and rest my pen for the time being.'”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“'Good night, Onii-sama. Until tomorrow.'”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
